<title>HONG KONG: Shun Tak sees stable 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Shun Tak sees stable 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shun Tak Holdings Ltd chairman Stanley Ho said on Wednesday he expected the company's results for this fiscal year to be stable.</p>
<p>He told reporters its earnings would hit a climax in late 1997 and in 1998 because the sale of its Belcher Gardens development, a key property project of the company, would start in late 1997.</p>
<p>Shun Tak post an interim net profit of HK$178.5 million in the first half of this year, against HK$258.6 million in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
